<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #171717; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>Hi {{ first_name }},</p>
    <p>
      Thanks for submitting your information. An attorney will review your background
      and reach out to you directly about next steps.
    </p>
    <p><strong>What we received</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Name: {{ first_name }} {{ last_name }}</li>
      <li>Email: {{ email }}</li>
      <li>Resume: {{ resume_filename }}</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Your tracking code is <strong style="font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;">{{ tracking_code }}</strong>.
      Keep it — you will be able to check your status with it.
    </p>
    <p>No action is needed from you right now.</p>
    <p>— Alma</p>
  </body>
</html>
